{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation", "label": "Flusso ordini e navigazione", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_five_item_nav", "label": "Navigazione a cinque voci (Sala, Ordina, Giornata, Menu, Archivio)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each item answers a different question (where are they sitting / I'm taking an order / what is open now / what do I sell / what did I take in); the sidebar used to mix eleven work and configuration items."}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_shared_order_panel", "label": "Pannello ordine condiviso (OrderPanel)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The per-order block is extracted into one component used from several places: three copies of the same void logic would diverge at the first bugfix."}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_giornata", "label": "Giornata screen (current service day, not calendar day)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At one in the morning the evening's orders must stay here, not vanish into the archive while the room is still full."}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_archivio", "label": "Archivio (past service days, expandable orders)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_line_price_edit", "label": "PATCH /orders/:id/items/:itemId/price", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_generico_product", "label": "Prodotto Generico with \"prezzo da definire\"", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The signal sits on the product and not on a zero price, because amari and coffee are almost always offered and a value-based warning would always be lit."}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_offerto", "label": "\"Offerto\" label on preconto for zero rows", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_ordina_no_checkout", "label": "Ordina composes and sends, never takes payment", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The till is a separate physical machine; calling the order-composing screen \"Cassa\" was a lie about the physical world."}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_prendi_ordine", "label": "Prendi ordine from a free table (/pos?table=<id>)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_use_send_kot", "label": "useSendKot shared hook", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_split_check_removed", "label": "Split check removed (migration v91)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Splitting kept costing: an order stopped being one bill and six routes needed guards; what goes to the table is a preconto and who pays what is settled at the till."}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_pending_dish_count", "label": "pendingDishCount (counts dishes not rows)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_whatsapp_disabled", "label": "WhatsApp switched off (WHATSAPP_AVAILABLE)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_palmari_item", "label": "Palmari sidebar item (QR modal)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_discount_new_total", "label": "Sconto sul conto come nuovo totale", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At the restaurant a discount is almost always a rounding (\"sono 53,40, facciamo 50\") and the subtraction had to be done in one's head; the new total is the first method, with ready-made proposals (drop the cents, down to 5 or 10 euros), the server computes the discount in main/services/discounts.ts and the preconto prints the usual \"Sconto\" line; the total never drops below the cover because the discount only touches the dishes."}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_discount_methods", "label": "discount_methods: ogni metodo di sconto acceso da solo (migrazione v99)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaces the old single choice \"entrambi / solo % / solo importo\"; early payment still offers only percentage and amount."}, {"id": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_discount_carry_rule", "label": "Una regola sola per lo sconto dopo un cambio del conto", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A percentage is recomputed on the dishes while a euro discount stays as agreed and never exceeds the dishes left; before, a line price correction rescaled euro discounts too, so the \"facciamo 50\" discount changed at every correction."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_line_price_edit", "target": "docs_api_discounts", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_ordina_no_checkout", "target": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation_shared_order_panel", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_order_flow_and_navigation", "target": "docs_palmare", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/order-flow-and-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_order_flow_and_navig